\newlabel{eq:plasticmemory}{{8}{2}{What each history stores}{equation.8}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The decisive difference is the content of memory. Both methods remember $F_P^-$; only the direct history also stores the elastic parent-child mismatch.}}{2}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
